{"id":"621337","name":"卤猪蹄","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/621337/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪蹄","amount":"4只"}],"sub":[{"name":"花椒","amount":"1把"},{"name":"大料","amount":"2-3颗"},{"name":"桂皮","amount":"1块"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"3-4片"},{"name":"干辣椒","amount":"1个"},{"name":"豆腐乳汁","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪蹄对半剁……剁不开就算了。","img":"images/621337/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冷水下锅焯水。","img":"images/621337/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"开锅撇去浮末。","img":"images/621337/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"继续煮五分钟，继续撇浮末。","img":"images/621337/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮好用凉水冲洗干净。","img":"images/621337/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入高压电饭锅，放入花椒大料香叶，干辣椒。","img":"images/621337/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入豆腐乳汁少许，灵魂味道。","img":"images/621337/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入料酒。","img":"images/621337/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入酱油。","img":"images/621337/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入蚝油。","img":"images/621337/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入糖色。","img":"images/621337/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入清水。","img":"images/621337/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"高压电饭锅用蹄筋模式。","img":"images/621337/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/621337/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}